      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Entrapment of the distal tip of a balloon catheter occurred during attempted passage between the struts of a stent into a side branch. Traction on the balloon resulted in fracture of the catheter shaft requiring extraction with percutaneous retrieval forceps."},
